---
// Ill01MoneyJourney.astro
// Visual brief: The Money Journey — From ₹5 Cr to ₹2 Cr Profit across asset classes
---

<div class="my-10 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900/90 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 bg-slate-100/60 dark:bg-navy-950/60 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-semibold">Editorial Visual 01</div>
      <h3 class="text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-semibold m-0">The Money Journey</h3>
    </div>
    <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 rounded border border-amber-500/20 font-medium">Layered Architecture</span>
  </div>

  <div class="p-6">
    <!-- Flow Diagram -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 items-center">
      <!-- Step 1: Investor -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/30 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Investor</span>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono mt-1">₹5 Crore</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">Capital Contributed</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Arrow 1 -->
      <div class="hidden md:flex justify-center text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2: AIF Vehicle -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700/60 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/30 border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 mb-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider">AIF Vehicle</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mt-1">Pooled Portfolio</span>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 justify-center mt-2">
          <span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 rounded text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Equities</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 rounded text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Bonds</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 rounded text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Derivatives</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-navy-900 rounded text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Unlisted</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3: Economic Return -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50/50 dark:bg-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-700/60 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Profit</span>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 font-mono mt-1">+₹2 Crore</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">Economic Return</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Final Question Callout -->
    <div class="mt-6 p-4 rounded-lg bg-navy-900 text-white text-center dark:bg-navy-950 border border-slate-800">
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-1">The Fundamental Dilemma</div>
      <p class="text-lg font-bold m-0 tracking-tight">Who earned this ₹2 Crore?</p>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-6 mt-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span> The Human Investor? (Economic Owner)</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span> The Fund / Trustee? (Legal Actor)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-100/50 dark:bg-navy-950/40 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs italic text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 m-0">Economics can trace the money. Tax law must decide who owns the income.</p>
  </div>
</div>
